          Real.log (Y / (Ideal.absNorm (p : IsDedekindDomain.HeightOneSpectrum (NumberField.RingOfIntegers K)).asIdeal : ℝ)))
      - (∑' p : {p : IsDedekindDomain.HeightOneSpectrum (NumberField.RingOfIntegers K) //
            (Ideal.absNorm p.asIdeal : ℝ) ≤ Real.exp (-δ) * Y},
